{"card_name": "Personal Sanctuary", "oracle_id": "20963cad-1c13-44a1-901a-bfc9930089e6", "cluster": "leading-condition-wrapped-static", "status": "source-proposed", "files": ["crates/ironsmith-compiler-grammar/src/keyword_static/leading_condition_wrapper.rs", "crates/ironsmith-compiler-grammar/src/keyword_static/mod.rs"], "test": "crates/ironsmith-compiler-runtime/tests/leading_condition_wrapped_statics.rs::personal_sanctuary_prevention_is_gated_on_your_turn", "gameplay_gap": null, "notes": "No general 'During your turn, <static>' / 'As long as <cond>, <static>' composition existed; each condition-aware static rule handled its own surface. New last-resort registry rule (heads during your / as long) splits the leading condition, requires that no other rule reads the whole line (thread-local reentrancy guard), parses the single-sentence remainder with the full static registry and wraps each result in ConditionalStaticAbility (CR 604.2/611.3a). Not build-verified: relies on remainder rules parse_prevent_all_damage_to_you_line / parse_attached_prevent_all_damage_dealt_to_attached_line and the full-party condition."}
